Here is a production-grade, modular implementation of a Cloud-Native API Gateway in C# using .NET 8. 

This implementation leverages **Yarp.ReverseProxy** for high-performance routing, built-in **ASP.NET Core JWT Bearer authentication**, and custom **Middleware** for distributed tracing and correlation ID propagation.

---

### Project Setup

Create a new ASP.NET Core Web API project and install the required NuGet packages:

```bash
dotnet new web -n CloudNativeApiGateway
cd CloudNativeApiGateway
dotnet add package Yarp.ReverseProxy
dotnet add package Microsoft.AspNetCore.Authentication.JwtBearer
```

---

### 1. Project Structure

```text
CloudNativeApiGateway/
│
├── Program.cs                      # Composition root & pipeline configuration
├── appsettings.json                # YARP routes & JWT configurations
├── Middleware/
│   └── DistributedTracingMiddleware.cs # Correlation ID & Tracing injection
└── Security/
    └── AuthorizationPolicies.cs    # Scope-based authorization setup
```

---

### 2. Configuration (`appsettings.json`)

Configure the downstream microservice routing clusters, load balancing policies, and JWT validation parameters.

```json
{
  "Logging": {
    "LogLevel": {
      "Default": "Information",
      "Microsoft.AspNetCore": "Warning"
    }
  },
  "AllowedHosts": "*",
  "JwtSettings": {
    "Authority": "https://your-identity-provider.com",
    "Audience": "api-gateway",
    "Issuer": "https://your-identity-provider.com"
  },
  "ReverseProxy": {
    "Routes": {
      "orders-route": {
        "ClusterId": "orders-cluster",
        "AuthorizationPolicy": "RequireOrdersReadScope",
        "Match": {
          "Path": "/api/orders/{**catch-all}"
        },
        "Transforms": [
          { "PathPattern": "/{**catch-all}" }
        ]
      },
      "catalog-route": {
        "ClusterId": "catalog-cluster",
        "AuthorizationPolicy": "DefaultPolicy",
        "Match": {
          "Path": "/api/catalog/{**catch-all}"
        },
        "Transforms": [
          { "PathPattern": "/{**catch-all}" }
        ]
      }
    },
    "Clusters": {
      "orders-cluster": {
        "LoadBalancingPolicy": "RoundRobin",
        "Destinations": {
          "destination1": {
            "Address": "https://orders-service.internal:8081"
          }
        }
      },
      "catalog-cluster": {
        "LoadBalancingPolicy": "PowerOfTwoChoices",
        "Destinations": {
          "destination1": {
            "Address": "https://catalog-service.internal:8082"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

